    "period": "2020-01-02 through 2028-11-20",
    "regime_notes": "Low-VIX gate active on 48.7% of aligned observations. Strong positive 20-session paper IC, but the cross-section is only 15 instruments and the regime filter reduces effective observations; use conservative sizing and revalidate.",
